WEBVTT

00:18.382 --> 00:26.288
I see the mask come down again A stranger where my

00:26.809 --> 00:34.314
friend has been I feel the static start to rise

00:35.355 --> 00:41.300
Behind the emptiness in your eyes You're

00:41.340 --> 00:45.243
building walls of steel and stone

00:47.675 --> 00:53.859
And I'm so scared you're all alone I'm reaching

00:54.219 --> 01:01.302
out, a silent plea Oh brother please, come back

01:01.523 --> 01:07.886
to me This is the unspoken word, the space

01:07.946 --> 01:14.109
between the lines A desperate signal, a secret

01:14.229 --> 01:21.614
sign More than a feeling, more than a touch It's

01:21.694 --> 01:26.618
knowing that I miss you much You're not alone,

01:27.899 --> 01:36.445
I'm not alone On this dark path you've been

01:43.973 --> 01:47.355
He's standing there, a ghost in white

01:49.936 --> 01:56.200
Stealing all your precious light I see the

01:56.280 --> 02:03.924
future, dark and grey As he prepares to take you

02:03.984 --> 02:12.308
away I'm playing our song, a desperate prayer To

02:12.368 --> 02:19.434
let you know that I am still there The only way

02:19.454 --> 02:29.702
that I know how To save you from this broken vow

02:29.722 --> 02:33.825
This is the unspoken word The space between the

02:33.845 --> 02:41.596
lines A desperate signal, a secret sign More

02:41.616 --> 02:47.440
than a feeling More than a touch It's knowing

02:47.460 --> 02:53.463
that I miss you much You're not alone I'm not

02:53.504 --> 03:05.291
alone On this dark path you've been thrown

